"Players defend a central core by strategically placing specialized turrets along a winding path. Core mechanics involve resource management where defeated enemies drop currency used to purchase and upgrade towers, including rapid-fire turrets, slowing frost beams, and area-of-effect mortars. The visual style utilizes a vibrant, high-contrast neon-cyberpunk aesthetic with glowing projectiles and mechanical enemy designs. Players must optimize tower placement to maximize coverage and synergy between different weapon types. The win condition is achieved by surviving 30 increasingly difficult waves of robotic invaders without the core's health reaching zero. Success depends on balancing immediate firepower with long-term upgrades to counter elite enemy variants."